# A reshard addressed at the logical tree reshapes the destination still
# being built instead of the copy the tree resolves to.
MODULE: DestinationInheritsTopologyReshardHitsDestination
TARGET: DestinationInheritsTopology
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a reshard of the tree lands on the unpublished destination
PERTURBS: Reshard

--- FIND
    /\ shards' = [shards EXCEPT ![alias] = Shards]
--- REPLACE
    /\ shards' = [shards EXCEPT ![IF destReg /\ phase = "Build" THEN dest ELSE alias] = Shards]
--- END
